			"notes": "## What's Changed\n\n### New Features\n- Added support for **searching notes** with the `/searchnotes` command, example: `/searchnotes mob farm`\n- Added support for **editing notes by ID** with the `/editnote` command, example: `editnote 4`\n\n___\n\nSupported for Minecraft 1.21.x\nReport any bugs and issues to the [Issue Tracker](https://github.com/smit4k/quicknote/issues)"
