			"notes": "## What's Changed\n\n### New Features\n- Added support for **tags** using #tagname syntax, example: `/note mine spruce wood #todo`\n\n### Minor Changes\n- Use `@` for coordinates and `on` for timestamps for clarity when viewing notes\n- Reorder note display: show tags first, then coordinates, followed by timestamp\n\n___\n\nSupported for Minecraft 1.21.x\nReport any bugs and issues to the [Issue Tracker](https://github.com/smit4k/quicknote/issues)"
